# Commander numpad module (rev N0) - one of the two sliding-tray modules (NUMPAD_MODULE of the chassis model,
# 131 x 68 mm).  A USB HID keyboard (keypad page) on its own USB-C, so it also works on any other computer.
# Same microcontroller and USB circuit as the keyboard (STC8H8K64U at 5 V, crystal-less USB, STC USB boot loader):
# one part list, one firmware tool chain.  Firmware is new - pin table in README.md.
SHEET np_mcu

U1 STC8H_LQFP32:STC8H8K64U 10=VCC5 11=VCC5 12=GND
P U1 8=UCAP 13=USB_MCU_DM 14=USB_MCU_DP
# status LED (Num Lock), sunk by the microcontroller
P U1 31=LED_K
NC U1 32
C1 1uF UCAP GND
C2 100nF VCC5 GND
C3 100nF VCC5 GND
C4 4.7uF VCC5 GND
R1 1K VCC5 LED_A
D1 LED:GREEN A=LED_A K=LED_K

# --- USB-C, device side (5.1 k on both CC lines), 500 mA resettable fuse ---
J1 USBC16_MID A1=GND A12=GND B1=GND B12=GND SH=GND A4=VBUS_USB A9=VBUS_USB B4=VBUS_USB B9=VBUS_USB
P J1 A5=NP_CC1 B5=NP_CC2 A6=USB_CON_DP B6=USB_CON_DP A7=USB_CON_DM B7=USB_CON_DM
NC J1 A8 B8
R2 5.1K NP_CC1 GND
R3 5.1K NP_CC2 GND
U2 USBLC6-2SC6 1=USB_CON_DP 6=USB_CON_DP 3=USB_CON_DM 4=USB_CON_DM 2=GND 5=VBUS_USB
F1 PTC:500mA VBUS_IN VCC5

# --- Framework input-module contacts (2026-11-17): eight gold pads on the underside where a Framework B-size module has
#     them (7.0 mm from the front edge, 16.96 mm from the left edge seen from the front), so the module also drops into
#     the tray like a Framework module - no cable.  Pads only (no part).  Pinout (Framework): 1, 7 GND - 2 VCC_5V -
#     3 USB D- - 4 BOARD_ID - 5 USB D+ - 6 SLEEP# (not used) - 8 VCC_3V3 (not used).  The data lines join the USB-C's
#     on the connector side of the ESD array; 180 k on BOARD_ID (Framework's reference value for a generic module) tells
#     the tray a module is there.  The two supplies are OR-ed (D40), so the USB-C cable and the tray never feed each other ---
J40 FW_PADS:DNP 1=GND 7=GND 2=VBUS_FW 3=USB_CON_DM 5=USB_CON_DP 4=FW_ID
NC J40 6 8
R40 180K FW_ID GND
D40 BAT54C 1=VBUS_USB 2=VBUS_FW 3=VBUS_IN
C40 1uF VBUS_FW GND
C5 4.7uF VBUS_USB GND
R4 22R USB_CON_DP USB_MCU_DP
R5 22R USB_CON_DM USB_MCU_DM
